            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa omwibule womundu yeetsa okhumubukula, oyo oumusambila amalesi okhurusia omulambo munzu, namusunjila ouli munzu mukari, mbu Oshilikhwo nomundu noho? Alakalusia mbu Abulamwo, khandi alasunga mbu Holeela; shikhukhoyile okhurala eliira liOMWAMI ta.",
